Z","updated_at":"2026-07-25T18:38:36Z","closed_at":"2026-06-01T16:17:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117337","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117337","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117337.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117337.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-01T16:17:45Z"},"body":"Fixes #117331.\r\n\r\nFixes a regression from #106503 which made `remove_control_from_docks(docked_control)` result in freeing the passed `docked_control`.\r\n\r\nAfter #106503 when a Control is added to a dock with `add_control_from_dock` it is wrapped into an EditorDock node by adding it as its child. On `remove_control_from_docks` such EditorDock is freed, but the wrapped control was never being removed from it, hence it was freed together with its parent. This is a regresion / compatibilty breakage, as `remove_control_from_docks` is documented to not free the passed control and tells clearly it's the user responsibility.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9095a76ff54ff96778c75260ac629cd4d1f1535f/doc/classes/EditorPlugin.xml#L681-L686","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Re